 these things from the wise and understanding,", "tokens": [51213, 300, 291, 362, 7633, 613, 721, 490, 264, 10829, 293, 3701, 11, 51373], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.16751980781555176, "compression_ratio": 1.7058823529411764, "no_speech_prob": 0.0004878347972407937}, {"id": 37, "seek": 14962, "start": 170.18, "end": 171.92000000000002, "text": " and revealed them to little children.", "tokens": [51393, 293, 9599, 552, 281, 707, 2227, 13, 51480], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.16751980781555176, "compression_ratio": 1.7058823529411764, "no_speech_prob": 0.0004878347972407937}, {"id": 38, "seek": 14962, "start": 172.52, "end": 175.28, "text": " Yes, Father, for such was your gracious will.", "tokens": [51510, 1079, 11, 7085, 11, 337, 1270, 390, 428, 36113, 486, 13, 51648], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.16751980781555176, "compression_ratio": 1.7058823529411764, "no_speech_prob": 0.0004878347972407937}, {"id": 39, "seek": 14962, "start": 175.9, "end": 178.86, "text": " All things have been handed over to me by my Father,", "tokens": [51679, 1057, 721, 362, 668, 16013, 670, 281, 385, 538, 452, 7085, 11, 51827], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.16751980781555176, "compression_ratio": 1.7058823529411764, "no_speech_prob": 0.0004878347972407937}, {"id": 40, "seek": 17886, "start": 178.86, "end": 181.9, "text": " and no one knows who the Son is except the Father,", "tokens": [50365, 293, 572, 472, 3255, 567, 264, 5185, 307, 3993, 264, 7085, 11, 50517], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.18200919825002687, "compression_ratio": 1.7981220657276995, "no_speech_prob": 0.0009253356256522238}, {"id": 41, "seek": 17886, "start": 182.24, "end": 184.26000000000002, "text": " or who the Father is except the Son,", "tokens": [50534, 420, 567, 264, 7085, 307, 3993, 264, 5185, 11, 50635], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.18200919825002687, "compression_ratio": 1.7981220657276995, "no_speech_prob": 0.0009253356256522238}, {"id": 42, "seek": 17886, "start": 184.60000000000002, "end": 187.78, "text": " and anyone to whom the Son chooses to reveal him.", "tokens": [50652, 293, 2878, 281, 7101, 264, 5185, 25963, 281, 10658, 796, 13, 50811], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.18200919825002687, "compression_ratio": 1.7981220657276995, "no_speech_prob": 0.0009253356256522238}, {"id": 43, "seek": 17886, "start": 188.74, "end": 191.14000000000001, "text": " Then turning to the disciples, he said privately,", "tokens": [50859, 1396, 6246, 281, 264, 17209, 11, 415, 848, 31919, 11, 50979], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.18200919825002687, "compression_ratio": 1.7981220657276995, "no_speech_prob": 0.0009253356256522238}, {"id": 44, "seek": 17886, "start": 192.12, "end": 195.14000000000001, "text": " Blessed are the eyes that see what you see.", "tokens": [51028, 37501, 366, 264, 2575, 300, 536, 437, 291, 536, 13, 51179], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.18200919825002687, "compression_ratio": 1.7981220657276995, "no_speech_prob": 0.0009253356256522238}, {"id": 45, "seek": 17886, "start": 195.76000000000002, "end": 199.52, "text": " For I tell you that many prophets and kings desire to see what you see,", "tokens": [51210, 1171, 286, 980, 291, 300, 867, 27297, 293, 21581, 7516, 281, 536, 437, 291, 536, 11, 51398], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.18200919825002687, "compression_ratio": 1.7981220657276995, "no_speech_prob": 0.0009253356256522238}, {"id": 46, "seek": 17886, "start": 199.98000000000002, "end": 201.22000000000003, "text": " and did not see it,", "tokens": [51421, 293, 630, 406, 536, 309, 11, 51483], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.18200919825002687, "compression_ratio": 1.7981220657276995, "no_speech_prob": 0.0009253356256522238}, {"id": 47, "seek": 17886, "start": 201.60000000000002, "end": 205.20000000000002, "text": " and to hear what you hear, and did not hear it.", "tokens": [51502, 293, 281, 1568, 437, 291, 1568, 11, 293, 630, 406, 1568, 309, 13, 51682], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.18200919825002687, "compression_ratio": 1.7981220657276995, "no_speech_prob": 0.0009253356256522238}, {"id": 48, "seek": 17886, "start": 206.98000000000002, "end": 208.06, "text": " And behold,", "tokens": [51771, 400, 27234, 11, 51825], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.18200919825002687, "compression_ratio": 1.7981220657276995, "no_speech_prob": 0.0009253356256522238}, {"id": 49, "seek": 20886, "start": 208.86, "end": 211.20000000000002, "text": " there stood up to put him to the test, saying,", "tokens": [50365, 456, 9371, 493, 281, 829, 796, 281, 264, 1500, 11, 1566, 11, 50482], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.270823834547356, "compression_ratio": 1.8, "no_speech_prob": 0.0017681379104033113}, {"id": 50, "seek": 20886, "start": 211.92000000000002, "end": 215.02, "text": " Teacher, what shall I do to inherit eternal life?", "tokens": [50518, 19745, 11, 437, 4393, 286, 360, 281, 21389, 14503, 993, 30, 50673], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.270823834547356, "compression_ratio": 1.8, "no_speech_prob": 0.0017681379104033113}, {"id": 51, "seek": 20886, "start": 215.72000000000003, "end": 216.64000000000001, "text": " He said to him,", "tokens": [50708, 634, 848, 281, 796, 11, 50754], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.270823834547356, "compression_ratio": 1.8, "no_speech_prob": 0.0017681379104033113}, {"id": 52, "seek": 20886, "start": 217.34, "end": 218.74, "text": " What is written in the law?", "tokens": [50789, 708, 307, 3720, 294, 264, 2101, 30, 50859], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.270823834547356, "compression_ratio": 1.8, "no_speech_prob": 0.0017681379104033113}, {"id": 53, "seek": 20886, "start": 219.20000000000002, "end": 220.46, "text": " How do you read it?", "tokens": [50882, 1012, 360, 291, 1401, 309, 30, 50945], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.270823834547356, "compression_ratio": 1.8, "no_speech_prob": 0.0017681379104033113}, {"id": 54, "seek": 20886, "start": 221.10000000000002, "end": 222.08, "text": " And he answered,", "tokens": [50977, 400, 415, 10103, 11, 51026], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.270823834547356, "compression_ratio": 1.8, "no_speech_prob": 0.0017681379104033113}, {"id": 55, "seek": 20886, "start": 222.9, "end": 225.20000000000002, "text": " You shall love the Lord your God with all your heart,", "tokens": [51067, 509, 4393, 959, 264, 3257, 428, 1265, 365, 439, 428, 1917, 11, 51182], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.270823834547356, "compression_ratio": 1.8, "no_speech_prob": 0.0017681379104033113}, {"id": 56, "seek": 20886, "start": 225.48000000000002, "end": 226.5, "text": " and with all your soul,", "tokens": [51196, 293, 365, 439, 428, 5133, 11, 51247], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.270823834547356, "compression_ratio": 1.8, "no_speech_prob": 0.0017681379104033113}, {"id": 57, "seek": 20886, "start": 226.9, "end": 228.02, "text": " and with all your strength,", "tokens": [51267, 293, 365, 439, 428, 3800, 11, 51323], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.270823834547356, "compression_ratio": 1.8, "no_speech_prob": 0.0017681379104033113}, {"id": 58, "seek": 20886, "start": 228.44000000000003, "end": 229.5, "text": " and with all your mind,", "tokens": [51344, 293, 365, 439, 428, 1575, 11, 51397], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.270823834547356, "compression_ratio": 1.8, "no_speech_prob": 0.0017681379104033113}, {"id": 59, "seek": 20886, "start": 229.86, "end": 231.22000000000003, "text": " and your neighbor as yourself.", "tokens": [51415, 293, 428, 5987, 382, 1803, 13, 51483], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.270823834547356, "compression_ratio": 1.8, "no_speech_prob": 0.0017681379104033113}, {"id": 60, "seek": 20886, "start": 231.84, "end": 233.08, "text": " And he said to him,", "tokens": [51514, 400, 415, 848, 281, 796, 11, 51576], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.270823834547356, "compression_ratio": 1.8, "no_speech_prob": 0.0017681379104033113}, {"id": 61, "seek": 20886, "start": 233.78000000000003, "end": 235.14000000000001, "text": " You have answered correctly.", "tokens": [51611, 509, 362, 10103, 8944, 13, 51679], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.270823834547356, "compression_ratio": 1.8, "no_speech_prob": 0.0017681379104033113}, {"id": 62, "seek": 20886, "start": 235.14000000000001, "end": 237.16000000000003, "text": " Do this, and you will live.", "tokens": [51679, 1144, 341, 11, 293, 291, 486, 1621, 13, 51780], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.270823834547356, "compression_ratio": 1.8, "no_speech_prob": 0.0017681379104033113}, {"id": 63, "seek": 20886, "start": 237.98000000000002, "end": 238.5, "text": " But he,", "tokens": [51821, 583, 415, 11, 51847], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.270823834547356, "compression_ratio": 1.8, "no_speech_prob": 0.0017681379104033113}, {"id": 64, "seek": 23886, "start": 238.86, "end": 241.36, "text": " desiring to justify himself, said to Jesus,", "tokens": [50365, 730, 5057, 281, 20833, 3647, 11, 848, 281, 2705, 11, 50490], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.1872653309096638, "compression_ratio": 1.638655462184874, "no_speech_prob": 0.0008692120318301022}, {"id": 65, "seek": 23886, "start": 242.12, "end": 243.44000000000003, "text": " And who is my neighbor?", "tokens": [50528, 400, 567, 307, 452, 5987, 30, 50594], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.1872653309096638, "compression_ratio": 1.638655462184874, "no_speech_prob": 0.0008692120318301022}, {"id": 66, "seek": 23886, "start": 244.22000000000003, "end": 245.26000000000002, "text": " Jesus replied,", "tokens": [50633, 2705, 20345, 11, 50685], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.1872653309096638, "compression_ratio": 1.638655462184874, "no_speech_prob": 0.0008692120318301022}, {"id": 67, "seek": 23886, "start": 245.58, "end": 248.8, "text": " A man was going down from Jerusalem to Jericho,", "tokens": [50701, 316, 587, 390, 516, 760, 490, 15393, 281, 8139, 33082, 11, 50862], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.1872653309096638, "compression_ratio": 1.638655462184874, "no_speech_prob": 0.0008692120318301022}, {"id": 68, "seek": 23886, "start": 249.02, "end": 252.74, "text": " and he fell among robbers who stripped him and beat him and departed,", "tokens": [50873, 293, 415, 5696, 3654, 3870, 1616, 567, 33221, 796, 293, 4224, 796, 293, 47018, 11, 51059], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.1872653309096638, "compression_ratio": 1.638655462184874, "no_speech_prob": 0.0008692120318301022}, {"id": 69, "seek": 23886, "start": 253.24, "end": 254.58, "text": " leaving him half dead.", "tokens": [51084, 5012, 796, 1922, 3116, 13, 51151], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.1872653309096638, "compression_ratio": 1.638655462184874, "no_speech_prob": 0.0008692120318301022}, {"id": 70, "seek": 23886, "start": 255.36, "end": 258.82, "text": " Now, by chance, a priest was going down that road,", "tokens": [51190, 823, 11, 538, 2931, 11, 257, 15703, 390, 516, 760, 300, 3060, 11, 51363], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.1872653309096638, "compression_ratio": 1.638655462184874, "no_speech_prob": 0.0008692120318301022}, {"id": 71, "seek": 23886, "start": 259.24, "end": 262.52000000000004, "text": " and when he saw him, he passed by on the other side.", "tokens": [51384, 293, 562, 415, 1866, 796, 11, 415, 4678, 538, 322, 264, 661, 1252, 13, 51548], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.1872653309096638, "compression_ratio": 1.638655462184874, "no_speech_prob": 0.0008692120318301022}, {"id": 72, "seek": 23886, "start": 263.14, "end": 265.52000000000004, "text": " So, likewise, a Levite,", "tokens": [51579, 407, 11, 32407, 11, 257, 28471, 642, 11, 51698], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.1872653309096638, "compression_ratio": 1.638655462184874, "no_speech_prob": 0.0008692120318301022}, {"id": 73, "seek": 23886, "start": 265.52000000000004, "end": 267.56, "text": " when he came to the place and saw him,", "tokens": [51698, 562, 415, 1361, 281, 264, 1081, 293, 1866, 796, 11, 51800], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.1872653309096638, "compression_ratio": 1.638655462184874, "no_speech_prob": 0.0008692120318301022}, {"id": 74, "seek": 26756, "start": 267.56, "end": 269.42, "text": " passed by on the other side.", "tokens": [50365, 4678, 538, 322, 264, 661, 1252, 13, 50458], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.170224939593832, "compression_ratio": 1.6746987951807228, "no_speech_prob": 0.0022691921330988407}, {"id": 75, "seek": 26756, "start": 270.16, "end": 273.66, "text": " But a Samaritan, as he journeyed, came to where he was,", "tokens": [50495, 583, 257, 4832, 289, 9670, 11, 382, 415, 4671, 292, 11, 1361, 281, 689, 415, 390, 11, 50670], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.170224939593832, "compression_ratio": 1.6746987951807228, "no_speech_prob": 0.0022691921330988407}, {"id": 76, "seek": 26756, "start": 274.12, "end": 277.06, "text": " and when he saw him, he had compassion.", "tokens": [50693, 293, 562, 415, 1866, 796, 11, 415, 632, 12601, 13, 50840], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.170224939593832, "compression_ratio": 1.6746987951807228, "no_speech_prob": 0.0022691921330988407}, {"id": 77, "seek": 26756, "start": 278.02, "end": 280.64, "text": " He went to him and bound up his wounds,", "tokens": [50888, 634, 1437, 281, 796, 293, 5472, 493, 702, 21969, 11, 51019], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.170224939593832, "compression_ratio": 1.6746987951807228, "no_speech_prob": 0.0022691921330988407}, {"id": 78, "seek": 26756, "start": 281.06, "end": 282.72, "text": " pouring on oil and wine.", "tokens": [51040, 20450, 322, 3184, 293, 7209, 13, 51123], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.170224939593832, "compression_ratio": 1.6746987951807228, "no_speech_prob": 0.0022691921330988407}, {"id": 79, "seek": 26756, "start": 283.3, "end": 285.08, "text": " Then he set him on his own animal", "tokens": [51152, 1396, 415, 992, 796, 322, 702, 1065, 5496, 51241], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.170224939593832, "compression_ratio": 1.6746987951807228, "no_speech_prob": 0.0022691921330988407}, {"id": 80, "seek": 26756, "start": 285.08, "end": 287.78, "text": " and brought him to an inn and took care of him.", "tokens": [51241, 293, 3038, 796, 281, 364, 7714, 293, 1890, 1127, 295, 796, 13, 51376], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.170224939593832, "compression_ratio": 1.6746987951807228, "no_speech_prob": 0.0022691921330988407}, {"id": 81, "seek": 26756, "start": 288.62, "end": 291.28, "text": " And the next day he took out two denarii", "tokens": [51418, 400, 264, 958, 786, 415, 1890, 484, 732, 1441, 3504, 72, 51551], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.170224939593832, "compression_ratio": 1.6746987951807228, "no_speech_prob": 0.0022691921330988407}, {"id": 82, "seek": 26756, "start": 291.28, "end": 293.48, "text": " and gave them to the innkeeper, saying,", "tokens": [51551, 293, 2729, 552, 281, 264, 7714, 23083, 11, 1566, 11, 51661], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.170224939593832, "compression_ratio": 1.6746987951807228, "no_speech_prob": 0.0022691921330988407}, {"id": 83, "seek": 26756, "start": 293.96, "end": 296.7, "text": " Take care of him, and whatever more you spend,", "tokens": [51685, 3664, 1127, 295, 796, 11, 293, 2035, 544, 291, 3496, 11, 51822], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.170224939593832, "compression_ratio": 1.6746987951807228, "no_speech_prob": 0.0022691921330988407}, {"id": 84, "seek": 26756, "start": 296.7, "end": 296.9, "text": " I will repay you.", "tokens": [51822, 286, 486, 27522, 291, 13, 51832], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.170224939593832, "compression_ratio": 1.6746987951807228, "no_speech_prob": 0.0022691921330988407}, {"id": 85, "seek": 29690, "start": 296.9, "end": 298.62, "text": " I will repay you when I come back.", "tokens": [50365, 286, 486, 27522, 291, 562, 286, 808, 646, 13, 50451], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.1839020116542413, "compression_ratio": 1.5833333333333333, "no_speech_prob": 0.0014427778078243136}, {"id": 86, "seek": 29690, "start": 299.5, "end": 302.88, "text": " Which of these three do you think proved to be a neighbor", "tokens": [50495, 3013, 295, 613, 1045, 360, 291, 519, 14617, 281, 312, 257, 5987, 50664], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.1839020116542413, "compression_ratio": 1.5833333333333333, "no_speech_prob": 0.0014427778078243136}, {"id": 87, "seek": 29690, "start": 302.88, "end": 304.9, "text": " to the man who fell among the robbers?", "tokens": [50664, 281, 264, 587, 567, 5696, 3654, 264, 3870, 1616, 30, 50765], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.1839020116542413, "compression_ratio": 1.5833333333333333, "no_speech_prob": 0.0014427778078243136}, {"id": 88, "seek": 29690, "start": 305.56, "end": 306.21999999999997, "text": " He said,", "tokens": [50798, 634, 848, 11, 50831], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.1839020116542413, "compression_ratio": 1.5833333333333333, "no_speech_prob": 0.0014427778078243136}, {"id": 89, "seek": 29690, "start": 306.9, "end": 308.23999999999995, "text": " The one who showed him mercy.", "tokens": [50865, 440, 472, 567, 4712, 796, 13174, 13, 50932], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.1839020116542413, "compression_ratio": 1.5833333333333333, "no_speech_prob": 0.0014427778078243136}, {"id": 90, "seek": 29690, "start": 309.06, "end": 310.29999999999995, "text": " And Jesus said to him,", "tokens": [50973, 400, 2705, 848, 281, 796, 11, 51035], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.1839020116542413, "compression_ratio": 1.5833333333333333, "no_speech_prob": 0.0014427778078243136}, {"id": 91, "seek": 29690, "start": 311.08, "end": 313.2, "text": " You go and do likewise.", "tokens": [51074, 509, 352, 293, 360, 32407, 13, 51180], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.1839020116542413, "compression_ratio": 1.5833333333333333, "no_speech_prob": 0.0014427778078243136}, {"id": 92, "seek": 29690, "start": 315.0, "end": 316.78, "text": " Now as they went on their way,", "tokens": [51270, 823, 382, 436, 1437, 322, 641, 636, 11, 51359], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.1839020116542413, "compression_ratio": 1.5833333333333333, "no_speech_prob": 0.0014427778078243136}, {"id": 93, "seek": 29690, "start": 317.4, "end": 318.56, "text": " Jesus entered a village,", "tokens": [51390, 2705, 9065, 257, 7288, 11, 51448], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.1839020116542413, "compression_ratio": 1.5833333333333333, "no_speech_prob": 0.0014427778078243136}, {"id": 94, "seek": 29690, "start": 318.97999999999996, "end": 321.88, "text": " and a woman named Martha welcomed him into her house.", "tokens": [51469, 293, 257, 3059, 4926, 27787, 23668, 796, 666, 720, 1782, 13, 51614], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.1839020116542413, "compression_ratio": 1.5833333333333333, "no_speech_prob": 0.0014427778078243136}, {"id": 95, "seek": 29690, "start": 322.41999999999996, "end": 324.14, "text": " And she had a sister called Mary,", "tokens": [51641, 400, 750, 632, 257, 4892, 1219, 6059, 11, 51727], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.1839020116542413, "compression_ratio": 1.5833333333333333, "no_speech_prob": 0.0014427778078243136}, {"id": 96, "seek": 29690, "start": 324.14, "end": 326.88, "text": " who sat at the Lord's feet and listened to his teaching,", "tokens": [51727, 567, 3227, 412, 264, 3257, 311, 3521, 293, 13207, 281, 702, 4571, 11, 51864], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.1839020116542413, "compression_ratio": 1.5833333333333333, "no_speech_prob": 0.0014427778078243136}, {"id": 97, "seek": 32690, "start": 326.9, "end": 330.34, "text": " but Martha was distracted with much serving.", "tokens": [50365, 457, 27787, 390, 21658, 365, 709, 8148, 13, 50537], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.26471256759931455, "compression_ratio": 1.5982905982905984, "no_speech_prob": 0.0011602253653109074}, {"id": 98, "seek": 32690, "start": 330.91999999999996, "end": 332.38, "text": " And she went up to him and said,", "tokens": [50566, 400, 750, 1437, 493, 281, 796, 293, 848, 11, 50639], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.26471256759931455, "compression_ratio": 1.5982905982905984, "no_speech_prob": 0.0011602253653109074}, {"id": 99, "seek": 32690, "start": 333.17999999999995, "end": 337.47999999999996, "text": " Lord, do you not care that my sister has left me to serve alone?", "tokens": [50679, 3257, 11, 360, 291, 406, 1127, 300, 452, 4892, 575, 1411, 385, 281, 4596, 3312, 30, 50894], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.26471256759931455, "compression_ratio": 1.5982905982905984, "no_speech_prob": 0.0011602253653109074}, {"id": 100, "seek": 32690, "start": 337.84, "end": 339.29999999999995, "text": " Tell her then to help me.", "tokens": [50912, 5115, 720, 550, 281, 854, 385, 13, 50985], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.26471256759931455, "compression_ratio": 1.5982905982905984, "no_speech_prob": 0.0011602253653109074}, {"id": 101, "seek": 32690, "start": 340.06, "end": 341.56, "text": " But the Lord answered her,", "tokens": [51023, 583, 264, 3257, 10103, 720, 11, 51098], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.26471256759931455, "compression_ratio": 1.5982905982905984, "no_speech_prob": 0.0011602253653109074}, {"id": 102, "seek": 32690, "start": 342.34, "end": 347.4, "text": " Martha, Martha, you are anxious and troubled about many things,", "tokens": [51137, 27787, 11, 27787, 11, 291, 366, 15166, 293, 29402, 466, 867, 721, 11, 51390], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.26471256759931455, "compression_ratio": 1.5982905982905984, "no_speech_prob": 0.0011602253653109074}, {"id": 103, "seek": 32690, "start": 347.88, "end": 349.84, "text": " but one thing is necessary.", "tokens": [51414, 457, 472, 551, 307, 4818, 13, 51512], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.26471256759931455, "compression_ratio": 1.5982905982905984, "no_speech_prob": 0.0011602253653109074}, {"id": 104, "seek": 32690, "start": 350.79999999999995, "end": 352.96, "text": " Mary has chosen the good portion,", "tokens": [51560, 6059, 575, 8614, 264, 665, 8044, 11, 51668], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.26471256759931455, "compression_ratio": 1.5982905982905984, "no_speech_prob": 0.0011602253653109074}, {"id": 105, "seek": 32690, "start": 353.29999999999995, "end": 355.29999999999995, "text": " which will not be taken away from her.", "tokens": [51685, 597, 486, 406, 312, 2726, 1314, 490, 720, 13, 51785], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.26471256759931455, "compression_ratio": 1.5982905982905984, "no_speech_prob": 0.0011602253653109074}, {"id": 106, "seek": 32690, "start": 355.29999999999995, "end": 355.53999999999996, "text": " And she said,", "tokens": [51785, 400, 750, 848, 11, 51797], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.26471256759931455, "compression_ratio": 1.5982905982905984, "no_speech_prob": 0.0011602253653109074}, {"id": 107, "seek": 35690, "start": 356.9, "end": 358.64, "text": " Mary, you shall come to me,", "tokens": [50365, 6059, 11, 291, 4393, 808, 281, 385, 11, 50452], "temperature": 1.0, "avg_logprob": -2.3937098755430215, "compression_ratio": 2.215625, "no_speech_prob": 0.36356037855148315}, {"id": 108, "seek": 35690, "start": 358.64, "end": 361.17999999999995, "text": " and I shall also make sure that a person who has not taken from me", "tokens": [50452, 293, 286, 4393, 611, 652, 988, 300, 257, 954, 567, 575, 406, 2726, 490, 385, 50579], "temperature": 1.0, "avg_logprob": -2.3937098755430215, "compression_ratio": 2.215625, "no_speech_prob": 0.36356037855148315}, {"id": 109, "seek": 35690, "start": 361.17999999999995, "end": 361.52, "text": " is not to see me,", "tokens": [50579, 307, 406, 281, 536, 385, 11, 50596], "temperature": 1.0, "avg_logprob": -2.3937098755430215, "compression_ratio": 2.215625, "no_speech_prob": 0.36356037855148315}, {"id": 110, "seek": 35690, "start": 361.97999999999996, "end": 362.84, "text": " but to seek him at the feet of the incorporator.", "tokens": [50619, 457, 281, 8075, 796, 412, 264, 3521, 295, 264, 8788, 1639, 13, 50662], "temperature": 1.0, "avg_logprob": -2.3937098755430215, "compression_ratio": 2.215625, "no_speech_prob": 0.36356037855148315}, {"id": 111, "seek": 35690, "start": 362.84, "end": 363.67999999999995, "text": " So she went up to him and said,", "tokens": [50662, 407, 750, 1437, 493, 281, 796, 293, 848, 11, 50704], "temperature": 1.0, "avg_logprob": -2.3937098755430215, "compression_ratio": 2.215625, "no_speech_prob": 0.36356037855148315}, {"id": 112, "seek": 35690, "start": 363.73999999999995, "end": 363.91999999999996, "text": " Lord, give me mercy", "tokens": [50707, 3257, 11, 976, 385, 13174, 50716], "temperature": 1.0, "avg_logprob": -2.3937098755430215, "compression_ratio": 2.215625, "no_speech_prob": 0.36356037855148315}, {"id": 113, "seek": 35690, "start": 363.91999999999996, "end": 363.96, "text": " in this sentence.", "tokens": [50716, 294, 341, 8174, 13, 50718], "temperature": 1.0, "avg_logprob": -2.3937098755430215, "compression_ratio": 2.215625, "no_speech_prob": 0.36356037855148315}, {"id": 114, "seek": 35690, "start": 368.35999999999996, "end": 368.41999999999996, "text": " And he said,", "tokens": [50938, 400, 415, 848, 11, 50941], "temperature": 1.0, "avg_logprob": -2.3937098755430215, "compression_ratio": 2.215625, "no_speech_prob": 0.36356037855148315}, {"id": 115, "seek": 35690, "start": 369.47999999999996, "end": 370.03999999999996, "text": " Completely.", "tokens": [50994, 39978, 13, 51022], "temperature": 1.0, "avg_logprob": -2.3937098755430215, "compression_ratio": 2.215625, "no_speech_prob": 0.36356037855148315}, {"id": 116, "seek": 35690, "start": 370.03999999999996, "end": 371.59999999999997, "text": " And he said,", "tokens": [51022, 400, 415, 848, 11, 51100], "temperature": 1.0, "avg_logprob": -2.3937098755430215, "compression_ratio": 2.215625, "no_speech_prob": 0.36356037855148315}, {"id": 117, "seek": 35690, "start": 371.64, "end": 371.65999999999997, "text": " You know,", "tokens": [51102, 509, 458, 11, 51103], "temperature": 1.0, "avg_logprob": -2.3937098755430215, "compression_ratio": 2.215625, "no_speech_prob": 0.36356037855148315}, {"id": 118, "seek": 35690, "start": 372.12, "end": 373.44, "text": " no matter how many people have asked you to offer mercy to others,", "tokens": [51126, 572, 1871, 577, 867, 561, 362, 2351, 291, 281, 2626, 13174, 281, 2357, 11, 51192], "temperature": 1.0, "avg_logprob": -2.3937098755430215, "compression_ratio": 2.215625, "no_speech_prob": 0.36356037855148315}, {"id": 119, "seek": 35690, "start": 373.44, "end": 374.15999999999997, "text": " it's always\u5c31\u53ef\u4ee5.", "tokens": [51192, 309, 311, 1009, 36781, 13, 51228], "temperature": 1.0, "avg_logprob": -2.3937098755430215, "compression_ratio": 2.215625, "no_speech_prob": 0.36356037855148315}, {"id": 120, "seek": 35690, "start": 375.09999999999997, "end": 375.12, "text": " And we have to gather up all of these tiene where there is no mercy in them.", "tokens": [51275, 400, 321, 362, 281, 5448, 493, 439, 295, 613, 7066, 689, 456, 307, 572, 13174, 294, 552, 13, 51276], "temperature": 1.0, "avg_logprob": -2.3937098755430215, "compression_ratio": 2.215625, "no_speech_prob": 0.36356037855148315}, {"id": 121, "seek": 35690, "start": 375.12, "end": 377.29999999999995, "text": " So there is none but one which there is no mercy.", "tokens": [51276, 407, 456, 307, 6022, 457, 472, 597, 456, 307, 572, 13174, 13, 51385], "temperature": 1.0, "avg_logprob": -2.3937098755430215, "compression_ratio": 2.215625, "no_speech_prob": 0.36356037855148315}, {"id": 122, "seek": 35690, "start": 377.67999999999995, "end": 378.4, "text": " So let us pray together.", "tokens": [51404, 407, 718, 505, 3690, 1214, 13, 51440], "temperature": 1.0, "avg_logprob": -2.3937098755430215, "compression_ratio": 2.215625, "no_speech_prob": 0.36356037855148315}, {"id": 123, "seek": 35690, "start": 378.4, "end": 378.52, "text": " So let's pray together.", "tokens": [51440, 407, 718, 311, 3690, 1214, 13, 51446], "temperature": 1.0, "avg_logprob": -2.3937098755430215, "compression_ratio": 2.215625, "no_speech_prob": 0.36356037855148315}, {"id": 124, "seek": 35690, "start": 381.62, "end": 381.73999999999995, "text": " So let's pray together.", "tokens": [51601, 407, 718, 311, 3690, 1214, 13, 51607], "temperature": 1.0, "avg_logprob": -2.3937098755430215, "compression_ratio": 2.215625, "no_speech_prob": 0.36356037855148315}, {"id": 125, "seek": 35690, "start": 381.73999999999995, "end": 381.76, "text": " And let's pray together.", "tokens": [51607, 400, 718, 311, 3690, 1214, 13, 51608], "temperature": 1.0, "avg_logprob": -2.3937098755430215, "compression_ratio": 2.215625, "no_speech_prob": 0.36356037855148315}, {"id": 126, "seek": 35690, "start": 381.82, "end": 382.5, "text": " So let's pray together.", "tokens": [51611, 407, 718, 311, 3690, 1214, 13, 51645], "temperature": 1.0, "avg_logprob": -2.3937098755430215, "compression_ratio": 2.215625, "no_speech_prob": 0.36356037855148315}, {"id": 127, "seek": 35690, "start": 382.84, "end": 384.38, "text": " Let's pray together.", "tokens": [51662, 961, 311, 3690, 1214, 13, 51739], "temperature": 1.0, "avg_logprob": -2.3937098755430215, "compression_ratio": 2.215625, "no_speech_prob": 0.36356037855148315}, {"id": 128, "seek": 35690, "start": 384.41999999999996, "end": 384.56, "text": " Let's pray together.", "tokens": [51741, 961, 311, 3690, 1214, 13, 51748], "temperature": 1.0, "avg_logprob": -2.3937098755430215, "compression_ratio": 2.215625, "no_speech_prob": 0.36356037855148315}, {"id": 129, "seek": 35690, "start": 384.56, "end": 385.15999999999997, "text": " Let's pray together.", "tokens": [51748, 961, 311, 3690, 1214, 13, 51778], "temperature": 1.0, "avg_logprob": -2.3937098755430215, "compression_ratio": 2.215625, "no_speech_prob": 0.36356037855148315}, {"id": 130, "seek": 35690, "start": 385.15999999999997, "end": 385.23999999999995, "text": " And let's pray together.", "tokens": [51778, 400, 718, 311, 3690, 1214, 13, 51782], "temperature": 1.0, "avg_logprob": -2.3937098755430215, "compression_ratio": 2.215625, "no_speech_prob": 0.36356037855148